# {{APP_CLI}}

CLI for the {{APP_NAME}} API. Token stored in the OS Keychain via `creds`.

## Commands

- `{{APP_CLI}} auth set|show|remove|test`
- `{{APP_CLI}} <resource> list|get|create|update|delete`
- `{{APP_CLI}} --help` (full discovery at every level)

Full syntax, flags and examples: **Read** [`references/commands.md`](references/commands.md).

## Setup (only if `{{APP_CLI}}` is missing)

```bash
bun --version || curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash
api2cli bundle {{APP_NAME}}
api2cli link {{APP_NAME}}
```

Always pass `--json` when calling commands programmatically.
